window.products.push({"id":841056,"name":"Kalorik 2-Slice Rapid Toaster, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+-0MCtxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You don't have to worry about your eggs getting cold because you didn’t plan your toasting right — the Kalorik 2-Slice Rapid Toaster uses advanced technology to deliver perfectly toasted bread in a fraction of the time. This innovative pop-up toaster features special Rapid Toasting Technology which toasts bread 50% faster than your average toaster. Whether you prefer soft, lightly golden, or browned to a crunch, the Kalorik 2-Slice Rapid Toaster toasts your bread just how you like it. An easy-to-use adjustable browning dial features six shade settings to suit your preference. Three one-touch functions include Bagel, Cancel, and Defrost. The Bagel function delivers perfectly toasted bagels every time, while Defrost gently thaws frozen bread until pleasantly soft. Press Cancel anytime to stop the toasting process. A slide out crumb tray makes your toaster easy to clean and keeps your counter crumb-free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+-0MCtxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalorik","source_asin":"B08FXJMWP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXJMWP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXJMWP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":841057,"name":"Super-Sturdy 11x14 Gray Shadow Box Frame With Glass 1pk. Fill Large Rustic Wood Memory Box With Wedding Flowers, Jerseys, Pet Photos, Ticket Stubs, or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CTJVvRaCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Showcase your memories with the style and protection they deserve with our sleek, protective shadow box display frame. Protect your precious memories in our durable, upscale wall display box. Solid frame rails and backing, glass, and metal sawtooth hangers ensure your crafts, decorations, tshirt, small trinkets, programs, ribbons and collectables are safe and stylish. The simple, versatile design of our shadow box frames brings your collections to life The stylish farmhouse hardwood look of our rectangle shadow box is the perfect backdrop for concert tickets, collectible magazines, shirts, CDs, veils, taxidermy, or autographs. The thick frame fits in with any home décor and provides preservation for years to come. . Displaying your memories is as fun as making them with our easy-loading shadow box Just lift the back tabs and pull the tray to create your composite display. Create memories with loved ones when you design your personalized memory box then show off the beautiful beach photos, baby shoes with clothes, military patches, or tassels with diplomas. Customizable shadow boxes can be changed with the seasons No need to commit to one look year-round. Our cases can be changed to suit any need! Whether it's Christmas, Easter, Father's day, Mother's day, any holiday in between, a birthday or anniversary; you can redecorate your box for a brand new look. Give your son, daughter, niece, nephew or grandchildren a personalized showcase of their achievements and special moments. What’s in the box? One (1) 11x14 inch weathered-gray, wooden, shadowbox display frame with attached mounting hardware. Lifetime 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! If you aren’t completely satisfied with your order, simply email us, and we will respond within 24 hours to make it right even on the weekends. We absolutely guarantee your satisfaction or your money back!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CTJVvRaCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eucatus Best Products and Gifts","source_asin":"B08WRP47H7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WRP47H7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WRP47H7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
