window.products.push({"id":841140,"name":"WOHOMO Queen Bed Frame with Hug Me Detachable Headboard, Platform Bed Frame Queen Size with Round Corner 15.75 inch Hight Anti Slip Support, Metal Sla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wStH6nKNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【QUEEN BED FRAME with Hug ME HEADBOARD】The SPRING queen bed frame headboard make you sleep at ease, just like lying in your mother's arms, warm and bid farewell to the cold of steel; The headboard is high, so you can sit comfortably on the bed. Just put a few pillows behind your back, you can read or watch TV comfortably. 【GET 2 BED FRAMES】The bed frame can be turned into a 15.75 inch tall platform bed frame and no box spring needed. Use it with headboard or not? It's up to you. 【STABLE STURDY】The two integrated bed slats and two T-shaped legs in the middle of the bed are connected and fixed by two handles, which is the soul structure design of the bed for stable. The middle bed frames are fixed together contected with 10 slats to increase the load with 10 slats, the maximum load of the bed is 3500 pounds 【Non-SLIP】The matal bed slats sink down 0.98 inches, so that the mattress will be embedded in the bed to prevent sliping; Also the headboard will anti pillows sliping because of its 110° inclined and 24cm extending out; The distance of the head and foot slat, each is 11cm, far less than 18cm, to anti sink of the mattress in head and foot for improving sleep comfort; Anti-scratch pads always protect your beloved floor. 【NEVER SQUEAK BEDFRAME】Special noise reduction design: With mute cotton stickers between bed slats and the middle bed frame which prevent the metal slat from colliding directly with each other; The slats are fasten by screws which help slats be more compact for never squeaky and to avoid the bed slat without screws falling to the floor due to gravity bending and deformation. 【13.75” Under-Bed Storage Space: 】 Up to 13.75 inches under bed clearance provides enough storage space, saving space efficiently and keeping your room tidy and clean at all times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wStH6nKNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOHOMO","source_asin":"B09TWYCN52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TWYCN52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TWYCN52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
