window.products.push({"id":841158,"name":"Premium Cotton Wide Lined Border Eco-Friendly and Long Stable Turkish Towel Set of 6 (Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BUEkECS5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURY TURKISH ECO 6 PIECE TOWEL SETS Luxurious feeling with Indulge Turkish cotton eco 6-piece towel sets in your bathroom or vacation cabin. Our eco-friendly quick dry towels come in the size of 27 inches by 54 inches for bath towels, 16 inches by 28 inches for hand towels, and 12 inches by 12 inches for washcloths in dimensions that provide sufficient size coverage. Made of beautiful, soft and super absorbent natural eco-friendly cotton in Denizli / Turkey. We have been manufacturing the fine Turkish towels for over 20 years. We are experts in manufacturing high-quality cotton towels and pride ourselves on only producing the finest towels. WHAT MAKES TURKISH TOWELS SPECIAL? - PREMIUM TURKISH COTTON!  Turkish cotton is premium cotton that has extra-long fibers, it makes Turkish towels delightfully absorbent! Also, these towels are known to become softer, fluffier, and more absorbent with each wash because of this unique material. SUPER EASY TO CARE! First step: You need to wash your towels in cold water before use it. Because they need to be washed to become absorbent. We recommend that you soak the towels in cold water for 12 hours and then hang them to dry for maximum absorbency and softness. Please avoid fabric softener and dryer sheets as the chemicals will only reduce the softness of the towels. And please never use bleach. You can tumble dry towels on low heat. WHAT DO YOU GET WHEN YOU ORDERED? You will get a super luxury towel set includes 2 towels 2 hand towels and 2 washcloths! WHAT COLOR OPTIONS DO I HAVE? You have options to get fashion trendy colors of Wedgewood, Navy, White, Moss, Plum, Gray, and Aqua!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BUEkECS5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indulge Turkish Linen","source_asin":"B07H2KBRHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H2KBRHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H2KBRHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
