window.products.push({"id":841220,"name":"Antarctic Star Air Fryers Oven Combo 5.0 Quart Electric Air Fryer, Oilless Cooker 1300W Large Capacity Multifunction Health Fryer with Digital Touch S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TAiulPSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Healthy Cooking】The best part about this Air Fryer is that the air fryer can heat food from all directions without using oil for most of the ingredients. The food produced has a crispy texture. You don't have to worry about taking in excess calories when you eat your favorite foods. It's a fast and healthy way to cook. The device meets all standards regarding electromagnetic fields (EMF). With proper handling, it will not cause harm to humans according to the available scientific evidence. 【Easy to Clean】Air Fryer is equipped with a non-stick pan and a removable dishwasher safe basket, so it is easy to make the grease residue left inside after cooking to be cleaned off. After each use, please clean the machine so that it can be used cleanly and healthily next time. After cleaning, please wipe out the water stains to keep the machine dry and safe. 【Built-in Recipes】Air Fryer has built-in recipes to help you prepare fried foods, snacks, grilled and baked goods. You don't need to worry about not knowing how to cook gourmet food, the built-in recipes can help you do it. Even a novice in the kitchen can become a master cook. 【Multifunctional Air Fryer】Air Fryers are able to finish frying, baking, heating and other cooking methods, you can cook French fries, beef, chicken, pizza and many other foods. This appliance is for home use only. It may not be suitable for use in staff kitchens, farms, motels or other non-residential environments. 【Fashionable Touch Screen Design】Air fryer is designed to be able to touch the control display. There are buttons to control the time and temperature, as well as buttons to select various cooking modes. You can select the time, temperature and corresponding mode you want while cooking, and then make delicious food. The device has a built-in automatic shutdown system.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TAiulPSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antarctic Star","source_asin":"B09PB1MGLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PB1MGLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PB1MGLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
