window.products.push({"id":841237,"name":"Touching and Heartfelt Poem for Inspirations - The Difference Poem on 11 x 14 inches Double Beveled Matting (Black on White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QDfK+IGTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Beautiful and Inspiring Poem for all gifting occasions. Person receiving your gifts will be thrilled and full with joy. Shower them with your love, give them a gift from the heart, give them a poem from GoodOldSaying! We have Gifts that: ---Keep on giving and last a lifetime---Are motivational, Inspirational, Spiritual and Thoughtful---Appreciated because she knows you really care---Have potential to change lives---Make someone's day by bringing sunshine and hope. Like a greeting card, a GoodOldSaying poem can express your feelings, but GoodOldSaying can also be framed and displayed. It's a wonderful gift that will be cherished for years to come. -----Caption for entire poem----- I got up early one morning And rushed right into the day. I had so much to accomplish that I didn t have time to pray. Problems tumbled about me, And heavier came each task. \"Why doesn t God help me?\" I wondered. He answered, \"You didn t ask.\" I wanted to see joy and beauty, But the day toiled gray and bleak. I wondered why God didn t show me. He said, \"But you didn t seek.\" I tried to come into God s presence. I used all my keys at the lock. God gently and lovingly chided, \"My child you didn t knock,\" I woke up early this morning and Paused before entering the day. I had so much to accomplish . . . That I had To take time to pray!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QDfK+IGTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inspirational Poems","source_asin":"B07BR73BVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BR73BVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BR73BVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":841238,"name":"Home-X “I Only Have Pies for You” Fun Kitchen Towel, Baking Lover Dishtowel, Home Kitchen Decor, Cute Tea Towel, Dish Towel - 26” L x 19” W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10R+RznbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kitchen towels are one of the best accessories to have around because of their versatility. They can be used to clean counters, dry dishes, wipe hands, and more. But finding a good kitchen towel that you can rely on isn’t as easy as it seems. Some towels don’t have the right texture to tackle tough messes while others are too rough and don’t have a soft touch. But our kitchen towels can meet all your needs! We are proud to offer this adorable “I Only Have Pies for You” tea towel. These towels are small and thin enough to easily fold and store in your kitchen but large and thick enough to take on big cleaning jobs. Our dish towels are high quality and will last through many washes, which is exactly what they were designed to do. Don’t be afraid to take these towels outside to clean off patio chairs or outdoor tables. They can handle getting a little dirty, and they’re super absorbent. When you don’t have cleaning jobs for them to take care of, these towels look great hanging in your kitchen. They are sleek, modern, and chic! But they can easily be tucked in a drawer, pantry, or closet for safekeeping. Our towels are absorbent, so they can be used to dry many of your dishes from pots and pans to glasses and silverware. Order a set of towels for yourself, or get a set to give to friends or family members for birthdays, Christmas, or just because. Tea towels make a sensible and practical gift that anyone can appreciate. Use these towels to add a cute, homey touch to any kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A10R+RznbXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07Z5C6Y52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z5C6Y52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z5C6Y52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
