window.products.push({"id":841359,"name":"BingeAffect Can Shaped Glass Cups with Lids and Straws 16oz 6pc Set Cute Glass Cup Tumbler, Colorful Secure Grip Silicone Sleeve, Beer Can Shaped Drin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RoQwMIHML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MODERN GLASS CAN CUP: The unique design of this glassware replicates a beer can. The beer can shaped glass tumbler enhances your drinking experience. The feel of the glasses is the same as holding soda cans or beer cans. The removable silicone sleeve adds details to this can glass that is great for indoor and outdoor activities. So, grab BingeAffect premium glass can cups and toast to a more enjoyable drinking experience. PREMIUM DRINKING GLASSES: The sleek, lead-free, crystal-clear glass comes with a colorful silicone sleeve for a better grip. Our can shaped glass cups glassware is food-grade safe and eye-catching. The right drinking glass can make beer, tea and other beverages much more enjoyable, especially when there’s a special occasion to celebrate. These glasses are flawless and shining even after many washes and they’re totally DISHWASHER SAFE. VERSATILE GLASS CANS: Can shaped glass cups with bamboo lids are multi-use glasses and are not designed for any one beverage. Its great for drinking beer, as a water glass, traditional cocktails, cold beverages, soda, morning coffee, and iced tea, but can also be used as a shaker for colorful drinks in pubs, bars, restaurants, lounges, etc. Or as a practical gift for birthday, wedding or housewarming. PERFECT GLASS CAN GIFT SET: Exclusive 6 different color silicone sleeve with each set to provide for a better grip and to set our glasses apart. Either a silicone or bamboo lid is included. These soda can glasses are great for sublimation and DIY projects. The reusable glass straws and eco-friendly bamboo lids add a touch of modern to such drinks as cocktails, fruit juices, aromatic tea and many others. The drinking glassware set makes a great gift set. CUTE CAN SHAPED GLASS SET: 6 can glass cups with 6 glass straws, 6 bamboo lids, 6 colorful sleeves and 2 straw brushes per package. Each glass measures 6.4” in height and 3 with width, holding liquid of 16oz. The length of straw is 8.5” meaning you still have proper length left even insert in the glass fully. This glassware set is a unique option for a variety of beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RoQwMIHML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BingeAffect","source_asin":"B0BR59DPJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR59DPJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR59DPJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
