window.products.push({"id":841390,"name":"OTOTO Phil - Wine Stopper - Keep Wine Fresh with Reusable Wine Bottle Stoppers - Replace Wine Cork with BPA free Silicone Wine Plug - Fits Standard Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nxxkJxbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your Partner in Wine- With Phil by your side, you'll always be on cloud wine! No need to worry if the bottle’s not done, Phil balances on top and has lots of fun! Made by the Design awarded Studio OTOTO, these wine stoppers keep your wine fresh and tasty for days. You can still enjoy and satisfy your thirst from last weekend’s bottle! Phil perfectly fits standard wine bottles, you can easily replace your traditional wine cork with these fun kitchen gadgets A 'Sip-erb' Treat!- Looking for new home gift ideas? Beverage bottle stoppers are an awesome treat for yourself or fellow wine lovers! Putting the FUN in functional, this wine stopper is an incredibly useful gift for avid wine drinkers. After popping open a fresh bottle of merlot, simply plug Phil in to your wine bottle and get an air tight seal. A fresh tasting glass of wine will be waiting for you anytime you want! Everyday can be wine o'clock with Phil, the wine bottle stopper. Relax and 'Un-wine-d' with Phil- Need another glass of wine? Wine not? Done for the day? You can drink as little or as much as you want with Phil.This reusable wine stopper is made with BPA-free silicone that can be used over and over again! Free from all harmful toxins, this happy little wine plug is also dishwasher safe. Just give Phil a quick bath and he’ll be good to go. Had a rough day at work? Phil is here to help you sit back and wine a little with OTOTO's funny kitchen gadgets! Spruce Up Your Bar Cart- Looking to add some character to your bar cart? This balancing little buddy is a fun way to spruce up your freshly opened bottle of wine. Made with durable and food-grade silicone material, Phil leaves you nothing to wine about! This bottle stopper has an air tight seal that will secure your wine bottles all throughout the week.Our wine plug is here to give you nothing but a satisfying glass of red or white wine. Have bottle-full time with Phil, the wine guardian! A Sprinkle of Fun- Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nxxkJxbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B095KTSGX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095KTSGX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095KTSGX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
