window.products.push({"id":841408,"name":"Absorbent Handmade Braided Woven Coasters for Drinks ：Set of 6 9X12cm Square Shape Abujia Heat-Resistant Cotton Coaster More Convenient Grab, Great fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n2VGFLw-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Absorbent Beverage Coasters】-- Our hand-woven beverage coaster is more absorbent, heat-insulating and durable than typical cork coasters. Absorb sweat and a small amount of spills within 2-10 seconds. This coaster set can better protect your beloved dining table and kitchen countertops from hot water, coffee and tea damage or appropriate stains. 【Durable Woven Design】-- Each of our beverage coasters is handmade with non-slip natural cotton rope, which is thicker, larger and softer. Each knitted coaster is soft, strong and strong enough to be used for many years and is widely used in the backyard, Terrace, swimming pool, beach, bar restaurant or resort.With our natural and recyclable coasters, you can protect not just your tables but also the environment. 【Appropriate Size and Beautiful Design】-- Unlike the round coasters on the market, our coasters are 12*9cm square shape, which is more in line with grabbing habits and more beautiful. The thickness of 8mm can also better protect the furniture. Contains 6 or 8 coasters, available in white, yellow, Ripple color, dark gray, light gray and Khaki, suitable for rooms and tables of various styles. 【Easy to clean and store】-- Our square drink coaster is made of high-quality cotton, which has better water absorption than ceramic coasters and will not stick to the cup like silica gel. It is more convenient to clean than cork coasters, just rinse with water and hang to dry. The fabric coaster can also be bent at will, making it easier to carry and store. 【A thoughtful and practical gift】-- Using our woven coaster, there may be no wine stains on the tablecloth. From mugs to coffee cups, wine glasses or juice cups, our drink coasters for tabletop protection are suitable for any kind of drink. It is the icing on the cake for the decoration of the kitchen, dining room, living room, bar, study or any occasion. A thoughtful and practical gift for birthdays, holidays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, and housewarming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n2VGFLw-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abujia","source_asin":"B09D8H8H3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D8H8H3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D8H8H3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":841409,"name":"Encoreco Leather Recliner Head Pillow, Neck Support Pillow to Alleviate Tension, Neck Pain Relief, Black.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pAzb73lzL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Encoreco Leather Recliner Head Pillow is the perfect accessory for those who need additional support while sitting in reclined position. Being in a sitting posture for a prolonged period of time, without adequate support, affects the natural curvature of the spine, while also increasing the pressure on vertebral discs, ligaments, and muscles. Proper cervical support can help relieve neck pain and improve comfort. Ideal loft support is one that aligns your neck with your spine. This pillow is filled with high density, premium blown fiber and offers medium loft support. The blown fiber is hygienically sealed in a silk floss lining. There is a discreet zipper on the underside of the pillow to access to fill. Simply snip open the silk floss envelope lining containing the fill and remove/add fill to achieve the right amount of loft. To use, simply drape your Encoreco pillow over the headrest of your chair or sofa, and adjust it to the desired position. Once placed in position, the anti-slip material on backside of the pillow will ensure it stays in place. The weighted end feature helps balance the pillow to maintain its position. The Encoreco pillow is ergonomically designed and exemplifies quality workmanship. The leather will soften with everyday use and is easy to clean; simply wipe with a damp cloth and wipe with soft dry cloth. Leather that has a distinctively unpleasant odour, such as mildew or mould, is common in lower quality leathers or leathers that have not been treated correctly during or after manufacturing. Such products can be sold at a lower price due to lower manufacturing costs and skimping on stages like the treatment. Moisture in leather can cause mould to grow in the lining and damage may be irreversible. The result is a leather that retains mould, smells, and that continues to decompose. ENCORECO offers you a product made of top grain leather (not bonded leather). We invest in quality assurance. The leather used in our product has been cured and conditioned, and care is taken after manufacturing by packaging your pillow in a cotton drawstring dust pouch. Get yours today by clicking Order Now and adding to your shopping cart!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pAzb73lzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Encoreco","source_asin":"B0B1BC6ZQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1BC6ZQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1BC6ZQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
