window.products.push({"id":841646,"name":"FIXSMITH-Transparent-Boot-Storage-Boxes,Stackable Plastic Boot Containers,Closet Shoe Cases w/Reinforced Frame,Drawer Type,Foldable Shoe Organizer,Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519hj-4ffUL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"💎【TRANSPARENT BOOT BOX】Clear plastic boot storage allows for easy identification of contents.Not only for boots,but also a great storage box/container for almost anything as you like. Stackable design helps you save more space,and this transparent boot storage box is a smart organization solution for you and is ideal for your closet. 💎【HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL & EASY TO ASSEMBLE】Made of high quality new PP material, which is very durable and sturdy. Thicker design can provide strong load-bearing capacity,can withstand much bigger pressure,prevent deformation,so is more reassuring.When assembling the boxes,It will be easier if you push all of the creases into shape & fold the tabs before you start putting it together.Please watch the video and see how to assemble these boot storage boxes. 💎【SUPER VALUED 2 PACK】You will get 2 of the drawer type boot boxes in the package.These boot boxes are foldable and easy to assemble,Simple interlocking design makes each box connected together for easy carrying and reinforced frame for extra stability. Durable plastic boxes protect boots from dust and moisture while a built-in hole in the box allows air to enter to keep contents inside fresh. 💎【SPACE SAVING & MULTIPURPOSE】One piece construction makes each one easy to put together and folds into shape,when used,these boot boxes can be stacked up neatly and well organized,when not in use,quickly unfolds for easy and convenient storage to save space.Actually this boot storage box can be used to store other items like household widgets,small items of clothing and so on as your needs.It's also be perfect using them as lingerie drawers.Use your imagination and make the most of it. 💎【ASSEMBLED DIMENSION】Drawer box:20.28”L by 11.81”W by 4.13”H, Container box: 20.67”L by 12.4”W by 4.53”H. Keep your boots well organized and protected in your closet and anywhere you want to save the space for more shoes with FIXSMITH shoe/boot storage containers. We provide effective and warm after-sale service. Do contact us if any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519hj-4ffUL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIXSMITH","source_asin":"B08312LBNQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08312LBNQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08312LBNQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
