window.products.push({"id":841807,"name":"Bread Bags For Home Made Bread 2 Pack - Linen Bread Bag Reusable Natural, Bread Loaf Bags, Reusable Produce Storage Veggie and Bread Keeper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MKDV2QrBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you experience an odor from the bread bags, simply gentle wash them and odor will go away. Its a simple residue from manufacturing process, nothing more. Bread is one the most commonly consumed foods in the history of mankind. Ever since we learned how to bake, it has been featured as part of breakfast, lunch or dinner. Home-baked bread is convenient, nutritious and has tasty goodness. However, it does not keep for too long. Chemical preservatives are used to boost the shelf life of bread but fans of organic food are against them. So how can you keep natural, home-baked bread fresh for longer? Simply use our linen bread bags as your solution for baked bread bags. Why? Because linen is the perfect fabric for storing fresh, homemade bread, because it allows your bread to breath. Homerzon reusable bread bags are washable. You can re-use them by washing, drying and folding them for future use. They are perfect solution for bread keeping. We recommend to hand wash them in cold to warm water, as it is how the linen fabric is being recommended washed. You can secure bread bags with drawstring. Homerzon linen bread bags come with a drawstring. This one keeps your baked bread securely stored. They are easy to handle and can be made into a tight knot. They are a convenient feature of the Homerzon reusable bread bags. Linen Drawstring Bags allows you to securely store your homemade bread and even hang on the hook. You can also use these bags as cloth produce bags, as your companion for produce shopping. 3-Pack definitely will extend your bread storage needs. What is the dimension of these large 2lb bread bags? They are 13’ wide x 15’ long and they fit bread that comes out of 2lb machine. Purchase our large Linen Bread Bags with Confidence For perforated bags search for ASIN B0784NB27B","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MKDV2QrBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AdeptChef","source_asin":"B071VCHM72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071VCHM72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071VCHM72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
