window.products.push({"id":841962,"name":"ISKM LED Mirror for Bathroom 40x32 Inch, Framed Anti-Fog Adjustable Lighted Wall Vanity Mirror with Lights, Tempered Glass Shatterproof, Memory Functi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":349.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dqUUlhzyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Lights & Black Aluminum Frame】ISKM Framed LED Bathroom Mirror is more durable, elegant and modern. The front light and back light make your room brighter, making makeup, shaving and skin care more convenient. Made of high-quality aluminum alloy and thickened baking paint, the metal frame is lighter and sturdier, and better protects the mirror. 【Dimmable & Memory】ISKM Framed LED Bathroom Mirror can meet your different preferences and needs by adjusting different color temperature and brightness. Short press to change the colors(warm white 3000K/neutral lights 4000K/white lights6000K). Long press to adjust the brightness from 10% to 100% or change the color steplessly. In addition, the mirror also has intelligent memory function, which can remember the color and brightness of the last light you used. 【Anti-Fog】Have you ever been troubled by the fog in the mirror after taking a shower? Now just press the anti-fog function button before the shower to solve this problem! No need to wipe the mirror after bathing. In case you forget to turn it off, the anti-fog function will automatically turn off after one hour. 【High Quality】ISKM Framed LED Bathroom Mirror use high-quality tempered glass, which is not easy to break. Even if it is smashed by a hard object, it will not produce fragments. The waterproof rating of the bottom box is IP65, making it safe to use in the bathroom as well. Use high-quality light strips to reduce current noise. 【Easy to Install, Plug-in/Hardwired】Our Mirror is packed with all mounting hardware, which is easy to install. The two sturdy wall brackets on the back of the mirror make sure the mirror hangs securely on wall. The mirror can be powered by either wiring it directly to electrical cables in the home or plugging it into an electrical outlet. 【Shatter-Proof Package】Each mirror has a professional anti-collision waterproof packaging and it has passed the professional fall-proof test. With epoxy coat, this mirror is corrosion proof. It will not get corroded after 30days acid test. 【Support】All of ISKM Mirror are covered with 30-Days Money Back if you are not satisfied with the product, 1 year warranty, 3nd year warranty extension and lifetime expert tech support. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there is any question, we will reply to you within 24 hours and help you solve the problems. ISKM customer support team is always just one-email away. 【Note】The four corners of tempered glass require specific protection! The reason why tempered glass is strong is because the surface has pressure, so the mirror surface will not be damaged by any knocking. However, if the four corners are hit by a hard object, it will be damaged by uneven force. Please protect the four corners when installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dqUUlhzyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISKM","source_asin":"B0C6F9Z458","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6F9Z458","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6F9Z458","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":841963,"name":"Brass Blessing : 18 Sizes Clock Keys Set - 18 Prong Clock Winding Tools (5020)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qxcLc-6zL._AC_.jpg","description":"This set come with total 18 prongs, so this is best item as master key for all your clock. If you owe many winding clock in your stock but always problem for the key. Se of these keys are solution for you. Most of all winding clock keys available in these 18 prongs. Starting from 000 to 15 size. All of these keys are Made of BRASS and comes in Plastic Box as shown in pictures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qxcLc-6zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brass Blessing","source_asin":"B082GD1JMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082GD1JMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082GD1JMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
