window.products.push({"id":841970,"name":"Butter Dish with Lid (Charcoal) | Covered Enamel Keeper with Beech Wood Top & Plastic Lid for Airtight Storage of Cheese | Tray Holds Half Pound of St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617RfnnX8zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Inspired with Your Ease in Mind It seems silly to call a butter dish “easy to use” but because it functions as so many things, our unique butter stick holder makes it so you don’t need to get out so many kitchen utensils. That means less clutter while cooking and less dishes to clean. Unmatched Versatility While most butter dishes are just that, ours allows you to use it for other items and utilization. Because our dish is made from heat resistant materials, you can convert it into a pan for baking small servings of food like bread or casseroles. After cooking, use the wood top as a platter to impress guests. Seals and Protects Food As it also comes with a durable plastic, our well thought out design ensures freshness and longevity whether it’s left in the refrigerator or on the counter. Impress Your Guests We challenge anyone not to be awed at the fun and versatile uses of our butter dish. A great talking point, any guest would be wowed by the functionality and craftsmanship of our products. Product Color Variations Our classic butter dish with beechwood top comes in 2 great colors combinations for you to choose from:  Stone gray with a white rim Pure white inside and out Product Sizing 6 inches long 4 inches wide 2 ½ inches deep Stores up to ½ lb or 2 sticks. Fit almost all brands including Land O Lakes, Anchor, Kerrygold, Organic Valley, Breakstone's, Plugra, Tillamook, Cabot, Crystal Farms, Darigold, Keller’s and many others. Product Materials The interior is made of durable carbon steel, a vitreous enamel coating, and a beech wood lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617RfnnX8zL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Castle St Design Co","source_asin":"B07547HPQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-841970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07547HPQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07547HPQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
